Subject: [PATCH] compositor: avoid shader-only round mask on Watch3 R08

On the experimental Galaxy Watch3 R08 software-rendered image, the
Qt Quick software scenegraph does not draw ShaderEffect. The physical
round display clips its own corners, so remove the GPU-only corner
mask rather than depend on an unsupported shader effect.

This patch is scoped to the R08 machine in meta-noblesse. Hardware
rendering has not yet been validated; upstream submission has not
been evaluated.

Upstream-Status: Pending

---
diff --git a/src/qml/compositor/compositor.qml b/src/qml/compositor/compositor.qml
--- a/src/qml/compositor/compositor.qml
+++ b/src/qml/compositor/compositor.qml
@@ -264,42 +264,5 @@
     }
 
-    // Rounds off the corners of a round screen. The mask depends on nothing
-    // but the size of the screen, so rather than masking the whole screen
-    // again on every frame the system draws, it is rendered once into a
-    // texture that every later frame simply blits.
-    ShaderEffectSource {
-        z: 6
-        anchors.fill: parent
-        visible: DeviceSpecs.hasRoundScreen
-        live: false
-        hideSource: true
-        sourceItem: cornerMask
-
-        Component.onCompleted: scheduleUpdate()
-        onWidthChanged: scheduleUpdate()
-        onHeightChanged: scheduleUpdate()
-
-        Item {
-            id: cornerMask
-            anchors.fill: parent
-
-            // CircleMaskShader shades a source texture, and the source here is
-            // a constant: the corners are painted plain black. A single opaque
-            // black pixel, stretched over the item, is that constant.
-            Rectangle {
-                id: blackPixel
-                width: 1
-                height: 1
-                color: "black"
-                layer.enabled: true
-            }
-
-            CircleMaskShader {
-                anchors.fill: parent
-                smoothness: 0.002
-                keepInner: false
-                property Item source: blackPixel
-            }
-        }
-    }
+    // R08: the physical round panel clips the display at its circular edge.
+    // Omit the shader-driven corner mask on the Qt Quick software backend.
 }
